sentences.text:
The accused person Shri. Pynskhemborlang Masharing is accordingly directed to be released on bail on the following conditions:
i. That he shall not abscond or intimidate the witnesses, 2024:MLHC:531 particularly the survivor;
ii.

That he shall have no physical contact or any contact of any kind with the survivor during the pendency of the case before the trial court;
Date Of Decision: 11.06.2024 vs State Of Meghalaya on 11 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/8140090/
5 iii.

